    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμα-τροχιά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>driving side by side,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁματροχιὰς ἀλεείνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.422
				</span></i>
			; of stars, <i>common motion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τροχιῇ πεφόρηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.108
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> by error for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρματροχιά,</span>
			<i>track of wheels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				263
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				87
			</span></i>.</div>
